                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c8b7b407-8a43-387d-b744-586b54aa9f3a",
                        "entry_id": "3515aedb-9e35-3b59-afa8-b2197c748493",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To divest of flame or ardour."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b00ebf73-98e1-4e69-bd30-5b51586b2e9e",
                                "sense_id": "c8b7b407-8a43-387d-b744-586b54aa9f3a",
                                "text": "O Lycians , why are your hot spirits so quickly disinflamed?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "39361c58-3156-4145-a2b8-1e4d9d2e222c",
                                "sense_id": "c8b7b407-8a43-387d-b744-586b54aa9f3a",
                                "text": "The impossibility of obtaining more will disinflame you , and we shall be, then, a beautiful and honest exception of folks liking without loving each other , and soon you shall feel only the sweetness of a friendship so pure, therefore so durable."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "abbd460d-b233-4788-b18e-54f7a672adb8",
                                "sense_id": "c8b7b407-8a43-387d-b744-586b54aa9f3a",
                                "text": "Consequently, depersonalizing and disinflaming the situation are prudent tactics: maintain a calm demeanor, look confident, and remain assertive."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a1671831-7a7b-3908-b9c3-c05c7585d36e",
                        "entry_id": "3515aedb-9e35-3b59-afa8-b2197c748493",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To reduce inflammation (in)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5c442fb3-1f2a-4258-bde2-197232f17fcd",
                                "sense_id": "a1671831-7a7b-3908-b9c3-c05c7585d36e",
                                "text": "In many instances simple manipulation, a steroid injection to disinflame the affected area, or some other maneuver is suficient for most soft-tissue injuries."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4e5b1c8c-95bc-4683-9b59-2e0f0fd48a91",
                                "sense_id": "a1671831-7a7b-3908-b9c3-c05c7585d36e",
                                "text": "Treatment then may be needed to disinflame the scar, or to get rid of the chaotically formed scar, by deep cross-fiber massage or manipulative rupture ( Ombregt et al ibid) ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "79068337-eca1-4329-a2d7-761d60434867",
                                "sense_id": "a1671831-7a7b-3908-b9c3-c05c7585d36e",
                                "text": "Through Relations, it is possible to be aware of the uses Mayan-plants had to heal the bit of poisonous spiders, to restrict the blood of any would and heal it in a very short time, to refresh the liver, to purge and worm, to lower the faver, to calm hemorrhoids, to disinflame, to counteract evil eye, to cure headache, to heal sores, to open swelling, to grow long hair, to grow hair where there is none, to help in labor, and to employ as an antidote."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
